1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:04,700
[GENTLE MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,500
[MR. SONG] (In Korean)
<i> Just find the necklace.</i>

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,533
<i>It will lead you
to my daughter.</i>

4
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:16,100
[GENTLE MUSIC CONTINUES]

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,533
<i> Get her DNA to confirm.</i>

6
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:27,467
[GENTLE MUSIC CONTINUES]

7
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:47,233
What is that for?

8
00:00:50,333 --> 00:00:51,433
What's that?

9
00:00:51,433 --> 00:00:58,367
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

10
00:01:01,500 --> 00:01:03,000
Chairman Song...

11
00:01:07,833 --> 00:01:11,133
sent me to find a necklace.

12
00:01:11,133 --> 00:01:16,300
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

13
00:01:16,300 --> 00:01:17,333
It's yours.

14
00:01:17,333 --> 00:01:22,567
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

15
00:01:22,567 --> 00:01:28,333
He thought it would lead to
looking for his lost daughter.

16
00:01:28,333 --> 00:01:29,500
And it did.

17
00:01:34,167 --> 00:01:35,633
He wants to meet you, Hannah.

18
00:01:35,633 --> 00:01:41,467
[PENSIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

19
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:44,200
No wonder
they're so mad at me.

20
00:01:48,467 --> 00:01:50,833
But, uh, my job...

21
00:01:50,833 --> 00:01:54,200
My job as a translator...
What's that?

22
00:01:56,300 --> 00:01:58,067
I just needed an excuse...

23
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:01,300
to stay close to you.

24
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:08,167
[DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING]

25
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:16,167
So, it's all fake?

26
00:02:19,300 --> 00:02:20,467
The clothes,

27
00:02:20,467 --> 00:02:21,567
your concern...

28
00:02:23,200 --> 00:02:24,467
You were just pretending?

29
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:28,167
You just wanted
to get to know me?

30
00:02:31,267 --> 00:02:32,667
The chairman wants proof...

31
00:02:33,667 --> 00:02:35,800
that you're his daughter.

32
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:37,700
You should've just asked.

33
00:02:39,333 --> 00:02:41,533
You should've just asked me.

34
00:02:41,533 --> 00:02:43,600
I will tell the truth.
I'm here.

35
00:02:46,267 --> 00:02:47,333
Yes.

36
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,667
I am the chairman's daughter.

37
00:02:53,767 --> 00:02:57,333
[DRAMATIC MUSIC INTENSIFIES]
